Update 3, issued 20:30 27/01/2026.

Substation at Upton-upon-Severn (Marina Road) has been de-energised as a
precaution due to floodwater ingress. 1,847 customers currently off supply
across postcode districts WR8 and WR13.

Estimated time of restoration: 06:00 28/01/2026, subject to water levels.
Two mobile generators en route, ETA 22:00. Welfare vehicle deployed to Upton
Memorial Hall.

We hold 46 Priority Services Register customers in the affected area and are
working through contact attempts. 31 contacted so far.

Next update 23:00 or on material change.
